@guide A_Redridge
@name Redridge Mountains
@faction Alliance
@levels 15-21
@zone Redridge Mountains
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Lakeshire and the gnoll and Blackrock camps. Shared by humans arriving from Westfall and dwarves and gnomes arriving from Loch Modan.
@next A_Duskwood

accept Encroaching Gnolls | Guard Parker at the Elwynn border bridge.
turnin Encroaching Gnolls | Deputy Feldon, further east on the road.
accept Assessing the Threat
fp Lakeshire
turnin 65 The Defias Brotherhood [race=Human; optional] | Wiley the Black in the Lakeshire inn (if you brought it from Westfall).
accept Dry Times
accept A Free Lunch
accept The Lost Tools | Foreman Oslow at the broken bridge.
accept The Price of Shoes | Verner Osgood, south of the bridge.
accept Redridge Goulash | Chef Breanna in the inn.
accept Wanted: Lieutenant Fangore
accept Wanted: Gath'Ilzogg
bind Lakeshire
accept Hilary's Necklace | Shawn, at the dock south of the bridge.
complete The Lost Tools | Underwater by the broken bridge, a box on the lake bed.
turnin The Lost Tools
accept The Everstill Bridge
complete Hilary's Necklace | Murlocs on the lake; the necklace is in a glinting mud pile underwater.
turnin Hilary's Necklace
turnin A Free Lunch | Guard Parker at the west bridge.
accept Visit the Herbalist
turnin Visit the Herbalist | Martie Jainrose, the farm north-west of Lakeshire.
accept Delivering Daffodils
turnin Delivering Daffodils | Darcy in the Lakeshire inn.
complete Assessing the Threat | Redridge gnolls west of Lakeshire.
complete Redridge Goulash | Tarantulas, condors and goretusks.
complete The Everstill Bridge | Redridge Mystics and Brutes west of the lake.
turnin Assessing the Threat
turnin Redridge Goulash
turnin The Everstill Bridge
accept Solomon's Law
accept Selling Fish | Dockmaster Baren on the dock.
complete Selling Fish | Murlocs drop Spotted Sunfish.
complete Solomon's Law | Blackrock orcs along the north-east road and Stonewatch Falls.
complete Dry Times
turnin Dry Times
turnin Selling Fish
turnin Solomon's Law
accept Blackrock Menace | Marshal Marris at the east house of Lakeshire.
complete Blackrock Menace | Blackrock orcs in the Render's Camp area north of Lakeshire.
turnin Blackrock Menace
accept Missing In Action [optional; group=2] | Corporal Keeshan at Render's Camp - escort quest.
complete Missing In Action [optional]
turnin Missing In Action [optional]
complete Wanted: Lieutenant Fangore [elite; group=3; optional]
complete Wanted: Gath'Ilzogg [elite; group=3; optional]
turnin Wanted: Lieutenant Fangore [optional]
turnin Wanted: Gath'Ilzogg [optional]
turnin The Price of Shoes | Smith Argus, the Goldshire blacksmith (Elwynn). Combine with a training trip.
accept Return to Verner
turnin Return to Verner
accept A Baying of Gnolls
complete A Baying of Gnolls | Gnolls around Alther's Mill and Stonewatch.
turnin A Baying of Gnolls
accept Howling in the Hills
complete Howling in the Hills | Yowler is a gnoll at Stonewatch Keep.
turnin Howling in the Hills
level 20
train | Stormwind or Lakeshire area trainers.
note Leave by the south road from Lakeshire to Darkshire (Duskwood).
